{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "5d678b3222bfde9a76162b07deb04bb39e108bde42f6e26a11f60e957de05166", "ja": "新衣装、完成！", "zh": "新服装制作完成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dfa911202f1a874d322c13395e433372f8402de6defdf24fec287262ef762e48", "ja": "美咲が仕上げてくれた仮縫いの新衣装を見た\n美奈子、まつり、恵美は、その出来栄えに感\n動！　美希も巻き込んで、全員で試着してみ\nることに。その後のVTRにも、新衣装で出\n演するのだった。", "zh": "看到美咲为大家完成的试制新服装后，\n美奈子、茉莉和惠都被成品的效果\n感动了！于是连美希也一起，决定让\n所有人试穿看看。之后的VTR里，她们也\n会穿着新服装出演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "715164ec173aea3dd2a770dc3708eba076016bbf83d4e1dbf3a824ea8963b4a7", "ja": "アイドル達にとって、新しいステージ衣装は、\nいつだって特別なもので……", "zh": "对偶像们来说，新的舞台服装，\n无论何时都是特别的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "2ec03026869f7b206dbb09581c2837419b2055a68ce870a8d857e0353b65098c", "ja": "みんなー！　仮縫いの衣装が届いたよー！\n美咲さん、すっごく頑張ってくれたみたい！", "zh": "大家——！假缝的服装送到了哦——！\n美咲小姐好像超级努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1002_null", "source_sha256": "e0ab104d691ae5a6ed6c026d82c5932b4610c9fd8c3af095879578a9e00b3a42", "ja": "ゴソゴソ……", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "7fd1f886cbd7161174d2dce9dcb6f449a1d8f3d43d0abac808aa2cba2f294f89", "ja": "うわ～、カワイイっ！　美咲に感謝しなきゃ♪\nねえねえ、これってもう着ていいんだよね？", "zh": "哇～好可爱！得好好感谢美咲才行♪  \n呐呐，这个已经可以穿了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "3b19acfc0464763b2f8c092ee3491bcf22efe615ab987a6849a209ba870ae396", "ja": "あふぅ……。なんだか騒がしいの。\nみんな、集まってどうしたの？", "zh": "哈啊……总觉得有点吵呢。\n大家聚在一起是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "ca5592e3f5fc739b2367f25e41dfd78c92df58d722af04d9427c962c572a67ec", "ja": "美希ちゃん、おはよ～。\nねえねえ、この衣装、一緒に着てみようよ！", "zh": "美希，早上好～。\n呐呐，这套服装，我们一起试着穿穿看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "0c9c49f50b9ff50d450707dbd0d4368bbecf9ad70d8276ac8ed831668f199ed8", "ja": "すたいりっしゅ！な衣装にわくわくなのです。\nまつり、この衣装がとっても気に入ったのです。", "zh": "看到这么时髦的服装，让人兴奋不已哦。\n小祭特别喜欢这套服装哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "d65b3d75eeac42f7fcf68c2f1da94e52be232b65ed988346f879b9a485ac3d58", "ja": "{$P$}さん、この後の\nインタビュー、この衣装を着てやってもいいのです？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，之后的\n采访，可以穿着这套服装去接受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "3f3704cc110fa65473e398a40d36927444c862bed48e8b40de537b1a8f55ff91", "ja": "まつり、ナイスアイディア！\nそれめっちゃテンション上がるよ～、やろやろ♪", "zh": "茉莉，好主意！\n那样超让人兴奋的～，就这么办吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1009_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "cdecf7d4ecf7f036a5f14f7f2bc32e10e119ddc40842d5c27cb4c309680cb295", "ja": "ずばり、カロリーですっ！　ほら、アイドルって、\nファンのみんなに元気を与える仕事じゃないですか？", "zh": "直截了当地说，就是卡路里！你看，偶像的工作，不就是给粉丝们带来活力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "422d2a298768e648ade72b5319461ccf24e980355cdb56a01007da97c14ddacc", "ja": "元気の源といえばカロリー！　私は心もお腹も、両方\nいっぱいにしてあげられるアイドルになりたいです！", "zh": "说到活力的源泉，那就是卡路里！我想成为能让大家的心和肚子都填得满满当当的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "afa00ba9584731d27f285b61a8d7f21795f7302e827c01a7a4d44654f7212fe7", "ja": "ふふ、美奈子ちゃんらしい、サービス精神あふれる\nコメントなのです。見習いたいのです。", "zh": "呵呵，真是充满美奈子风格、服务精神十足的发言呢。我要向你学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "80d338345d836ad675f03d945170d02ab5ef4e44ab9dd2556038ec6f523a3648", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとう！\nそういうまつりちゃんの『輝き』は？", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！\n那么，玛茨莉的那份“闪耀”呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "4116baa0728bbf6e6ca7107f873c8a7818b31c20381ddeb61448777a34095a9e", "ja": "ほ？　姫は姫なのです。それだけで、姫はいつでも\nとびきり・キラキラ・わんだほー！なのですよ。", "zh": "嗯？公主就是公主哦。仅仅如此，公主就永远是\n最最闪耀、最最棒、无与伦比的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "e450bfd7e15aaa137372be8c4062699dea1f6c5cd3a08b92919bbbf500d129d1", "ja": "姫がいる限り、このお城がある限り、ファンの\nみんなにかけた魔法は、絶対とけたりしないのです♪", "zh": "只要公主还在，只要这座城堡还在，对各位\n粉丝施下的魔法，就绝对不会解除的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "77b6d4aac57335cb5f186db576d73bc1e997abf3bd92ccc8b6e4f5348e002f6d", "ja": "まつりも、らしいよね！\nん～、アタシは……友達、かな。", "zh": "茉莉也是，很有她的风格呢！\n嗯～，我的话……大概是朋友吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "2a2914a644f0f972baefc7dc7e6008b9f82a48f7599b128176b91734a6e8615e", "ja": "アタシね、友達といるときが一番楽しいんだ。\nだから、ファンのみんなとも友達になりたいなって。", "zh": "我啊，和朋友待在一起的时候最开心了。\n所以，我想和粉丝们也成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "a9b76ca55a72be7b0510861e9648fa8c1acde01f5098036d32457c28c9fd32b9", "ja": "いいよね、距離感そのくらいのアイドルがいてもさ。\nあれ？　これじゃ答えになってないかな？　にゃはは♪", "zh": "有这种距离感的偶像也不错吧。  \n咦？这样算不上回答吗？呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "6e3ca46486897786d7f5286b8f00349d99a4abd6e33c49f980b9c7c084fd2c38", "ja": "それが恵美の『輝き』ってことだよね。\nミキはそういう答えもいいと思うよ。", "zh": "那就是惠美的“光芒”吧。\n美希觉得，这样的回答也很好哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "134059eaf2124161a7ed56d6feefd5ad78e88631e992745c6ac4db913d800b25", "ja": "え、ええっ、なんか照れる～！\nねね、美希は？　美希の『輝き』も、聞かせてっ。", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？总觉得有点害羞～！\n呐呐，美希呢？也让我听听美希的“闪耀”吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "c8dfc441d04ea16bef2dd4061dcdf796fa40e8ff368d5ef0d9842e5acf554537", "ja": "ミキはあんまり輝きとか、考えたことなかったの。\n最初からわりとなんでもできちゃったし。", "zh": "我以前没怎么想过“闪耀”之类的事情。\n毕竟从一开始，我就已经挺擅长各种事情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "ea0dc0e49bebe31c0ac9ce0da202778493b92c945031d9230e2863a04ee8f77d", "ja": "でも、今は……大切なヒトに、一番サイコーの\nミキを見て欲しいって思うな！　あはっ☆", "zh": "但是现在……我想让最重要的人，看到最棒的美希！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "eb8149b55d88b33779fdb1667dbe78fe7eda48c656224395c2aa9fab35532394", "ja": "えっ、美希ちゃん、ええと……。\nその大切なヒトって、ファンのことだよね？", "zh": "咦，美希，那个……你说的重要之人，是指粉丝们吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_07_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "da48aa9ecb8de76c8762e9cbb0cdf2e9fdcfb5044833afae0f4e15bf84dbcc50", "ja": "もちろん、そうなのです！　新しい衣装を、\nファンのみんなに見て欲しいのです……ね？　ね！", "zh": "当然是这样啦！是想让粉丝们\n看到新衣服对吧……对吧？对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
